  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_5349.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>84 fotos de la proclamaci&oacute; com a Reina Infantil 2014 de Suera de la xiqueta Denisa Neacsu Nae. La presentadora ha sigut Gema Soriano Barcel&oacute; i H&egrave;ctor Maci&aacute;n Sorribes el mantenidor de l&#39;acte amb el qual han comen&ccedil;at les festes d&#39;agost, que s&#39;estendran fins diumenge dia 17.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5270.jpg\" alt=\"img_5270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5271.jpg\" alt=\"img_5271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5273.jpg\" alt=\"img_5273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5274.jpg\" alt=\"img_5274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5275.jpg\" alt=\"img_5275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5276.jpg\" alt=\"img_5276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5277.jpg\" alt=\"img_5277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5278.jpg\" alt=\"img_5278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreginainfantilsuera14/img_5279.jpg\" alt=\"img_5279\"